      "id": "3-motion-physics-animations",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "3. Motion & Physics Animations"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Located in [`src/engine/animation/motion/`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/animation/motion):"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "**`MotionPath`**: Moves an entity along an arbitrary 2D/3D spline or vector path with automatic tangent rotation.",
            "**`OrbitAnimation`**: Orbits an entity around an arbitrary 3D pivot coordinate at configurable angular velocity.",
            "**`ShakeAnimation`**: Introduces traumatic vibrational camera shake using Perlin noise decay ($e^{-\\lambda t}$).",
            "**`SpiralAnimation`**: Moves entities along Archimedean or logarithmic spirals ($r = a + b\\theta$).",
            "**`SplineAnimation`**: Evaluates smooth Catmull-Rom or Natural Cubic Spline trajectories through control points.",
            "**`SpringAnimation`**: Physics-driven spring animation with real-time mass, damping, and spring constant equations.",
            "**`LissajousAnimation`**: Harmonically driven motion governed by $x = A\\sin(at + \\delta), y = B\\sin(bt)$."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4-transform-morph-animations",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "4. Transform & Morph Animations"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Located in [`src/engine/animation/transform/`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/animation/transform):"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "**`Morph`**: Smoothly interpolates path geometry between two distinct vector shapes using Chaikin subdivision and arc-length curve equalization ([`PathEqualizer.ts`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/utils/PathEqualizer.ts)).",
            "**`HomotopyAnimation`**: Implements continuous mathematical homotopy:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "H(x, y, t) = (1 - t)f(x, y) + t \\, g(x, y)"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "**`TransformMatchingShapes`**: Analyzes source and target composite shapes, automatically aligns identical sub-shapes, and morphs unmatched elements.",
            "**`TransformMatchingTex`**: Parses LaTeX expressions, identifies identical mathematical terms (e.g. variables $x$, exponents, equal signs), slides them into their new positions, and morphs altered operators.",
            "**`TransformMatchingText`**: Word- and letter-level alignment for text transitions.",
            "**`SDF3DTransform`**: Continuous blending between two 3D Signed Distance Fields using smooth minimum interpolation.",
            "**`VectorTransform`**: Visualizes linear algebra matrix transformations:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "\\vec{v}' = A \\vec{v}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
